  "title": "Allow releasing beta versions",
  "date": 1489762918,
  "body": "Our release process should be able to release beta/rc versions of instantsearch.js and react-instantsearch.\r\n\r\nFor instantsearch.js, as long as we use jsDelivr auto npm sync we cannot do it. In the next breaking version we will need to stop depending on jsDelivr and start using unpkg.com or jsDelivr soon to be released npm proxy.\r\n\r\nFor react-instantsearch, for now we are using http://unpkg.com/ so we are good and @Haroenv is on it.",
  "user": {
    "type": "User",
    "avatar": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123822",
    "id": 123822,
    "login": "vvo"
  },
